 "description": "The receipt's logs decoded to address, topic0, indexed values and data size \u2014 what a transaction actually did, straight from the node, which is the only honest answer when eth_getLogs by transaction hash is refused. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/tx-events?chain=base&hash=0x55bd09129b86846556030b6036d48c75865b1f8e73ee6f7df60a22a56f3cd0d4.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
